              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1365,
                "end_index": 1669,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **A Systematic Geographic Coordinate Grid:** While concepts of latitude and longitude existed before him, Hipparchus was the first to invent a systematic method of using astronomical observations (rather than just estimated travel distances) to determine the latitude and longitude of specific places"
